# Local env files — VITE_GOOGLE_API_KEY lives here.
# NOTE: Vite inlines VITE_* vars into the built bundle, so the key is public
# in any deployment. The real protection is restricting it in Google Cloud
# Console to the Drive API + your deployment's HTTP referrers.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example

*.local
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

.vite/

# Generated by scripts/copy-decoders.mjs from node_modules — never edited.
public/decoders/

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
